{"id":"vod_sn_35753","vodId":"35753","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"有你的小镇","name_cn":"有你的小镇","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/17741ed89e23657c67109bf6c3ca1871.jpg"},"summary":"曾经从东京来到广岛念高中而寄宿在桐岛青大（细谷佳正 配音）家的枝叶柚希（中岛爱 配音），在留下一封信后，突然消失。她是不再喜欢青大，还是另有隐情？为了寻找答案，了解柚希的真实想法，青大离开了老家广岛，转学到东京，前往柚希所在的小镇。来到大城市东京后，青大暂住在姐姐的公寓里，在这里他认识了隔壁的御岛明日香（佐仓绫音 配音）和风间恭辅（小野大辅 配音），而他们二人正巧是自己的新同班同学。青大鼓起勇气去找柚希，结果遇到了柚希的妹妹懔，而柚希似乎不愿意露面与他相见。　　曾经点点滴滴的回忆，如今形同陌路的两人。从东京到广岛，从广岛到东京，相遇，恋爱，分离，重逢，这是青大与柚希的甜蜜又苦涩的爱情故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p1H2nmMRvG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ns4k9YAu2d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DC7XAH1pGQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hxb40cLff41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JkmQNRBrDv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yp1Ti5biLz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3bSGuf17KU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SZt6Su3c2i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SMiAPeqUhb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3QfmhfSsVz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4iu9Vn7JSF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UwkfcT0rKw1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.107Z"}